.ghost_chain_state

# Internal development notes — not for public consumption
task.md

# TLS private keys — test certs in certs/ are acceptable, but never commit real keys
*.key
# Exception: the example test keys in certs/ are intentionally tracked for local dev
!certs/*.key
task.md
